  "title": "Homecoming: NaturAll's 5 Year Anniversary! The History of NaturAll",
  "summary": "This year NaturAll is turning 5! That’s right, your favorite organic hair care brand is celebrating it’s 5 year anniversary. In honor of this grand moment, we’re having a homecoming celebration to honor just how far we’ve come! Read on to learn more about our journey from homemade products blended in a dorm room, all the way to the pages of Vogue and Essence!",
